Yep...

Magic whistles give the message "you produce a strange whistle" as opposed
to magic whistles, which say "you produce a loud whistle."  I'm not sure
about the wording.  But a magic whistle summons your pet to your side, as
long as he's on the same level as you.  A normal whistle just makes him come
running.  I think it also makes other monsters come running too though.


